"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=2621940","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2532010-1843481262689960","game_id":"steam-2532010","kind":"announcement","title":"Final Demo","summary":"Well it's been a very very long time coming. I am releasing in November! No excuses. I have been away and busy ( I have spawned 2 kids ) but I'm ready to launch!Please play the demo and let me know your thoughts!Looking forward to the future!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T17:28:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262689960","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2532010-6350729003490820346","game_id":"steam-2532010","kind":"update","title":"Demo update!","summary":"Well it's been a while since I've updated here! I tend to post my updates on other social channels while working on the game. But I have since updated the demo! Horray! Updates - Sprite and dialogue tweaks - New menu for costumes - Updates blocking door for boss battle As always report any bugs please! Still slated for a Q1 2025 release","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-10-02T14:57:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6350729003490820346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2532010-5410576585155652523","game_id":"steam-2532010","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1.1","summary":"So lets end the year on a good note. It's amazing to me how a small change can affect something else. Test, test, and TEST some more! Yay regressions! Shoutout to Game Wisdom for letting me know! Bugfixes: - Equipping the heart trinket caused an exception Chores: - Added version to title screen Please let me know feedback if you can! - hrok","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2023-12-28T14:22:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5410576585155652523","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2532010-5218041989052149768","game_id":"steam-2532010","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.1.0 update","summary":"Check out some of the latest updates! One notable thing is cleaning up some artwork I had for the prototype - the inventory/shop screens BEFORE: {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44456632/4657d65adec4765bbf7374fe298ad7694496614b.png AFTER: {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44456632/e78e80e6cf62a2205d7a45f1a905a9fc24f1ecfe.png Other things of note: - Remove inventory from initial pause screen during cutscene - Add UI for button when shop was open to let user know how to close - Removed collision damage directly on stinkbug - ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2023-10-22T01:46:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5218041989052149768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2532010-5220292521177706162","game_id":"steam-2532010","kind":"announcement","title":"Territorial Hissing Demo it out!","summary":"Hey everyone! We are happy to showcase the alpha build showcasing what Territorial Hissing has to offer! Territorial Hissing is a 2D sidescroller adventure about bringing down a corrupt corporation in an otherwise bright and colorful land. Save your home in this comedy adventure! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44456632/da4520e64331104ce26a54f9353d02da14e314ac.png {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44456632/3351494a4545fe2b9e195618f9bdec6b226a64af.png It is a short slice of the beginning of the game but will show the feel a","occurred_at":nul